		(property "Source" "NHD-4.0-480480AF-MSXP-CTP.pdf p.5 panel pins: 1 LED_K, 2 LED_A, 3 NC, 4 VDD, 5 GND, 6 DN0, 7 DP0, 8 GND, 9 CN, 10 CP, 11 GND, 12 DN1, 13 DP1, 14 GND, 15 RESETX, 16 CSX, 17 SCL, 18 SDA, 19 SDO, 20 TE_L, 21 IM0, 22 IM1, 23 IM3, 24 LANSEL. Reversed onto the connector: with the tail folded onto the rear face panel pin 1 is on the right (p.4 back view) and the footprint's pad 1 is on the left when the opening faces the bottom edge. Amphenol F32Q-1A7H1-11024 (top contact, DigiKey listing read 2026-11-10) because KiCad has its footprint; its drawing is not in docs/reference"
