		(property "Source" "NHD-4.0-480480AF-MSXP-CTP.pdf p.5 touch pins: 1 VDD, 2 GND, 3 SCL, 4 SDA, 5 INT, 6 RST. Reversed onto the connector (pad n = touch pin 7 - n) for the same reason as J2; p.4 back view shows pin 1 on the right. TE 84952-6 instead of the Molex 52271-0679 named on p.5, because KiCad has its footprint: 6 positions, 1 mm, bottom contact, 0.3 mm FFC, active (te.com product page read 2026-11-10; TE drawing not in docs/reference)"
